  "question": "Let $p$ and $q$ be two non-zero polynomials such that the degree of $p$ is less than or equal to the degree of $q$, and $p(a)q(a)=0$ for $a=0,1,2,\\ldots,10$. Which of the following must be true?",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\deg q\\ne10$",
    "B": "$\\deg p\\ne10$",
    "C": "$\\deg q\\ne5$",
    "D": "$\\deg p\\ne5$"
